.DS_Store
*.swp

# This checkout's own Skill Manager home and the three agent homes beside it.
#
# Created by this repo's OWN scripts/bootstrap-home.sh, which is the only
# implementation of the sequence. Never committed: a home is machine-local
# state (absolute paths in home.runtime.json, a pinned CLI, installed unit
# trees), and committing one would hand every other checkout this machine's
# paths.
#
# These live in the CONSTITUENT rather than in an integration parent's root
# .gitignore because they are this repository's own concern:
# `git-integration-repo` is a standalone repo with its own remote, and it is
# the repo whose script an agent runs to create a home in the first place, so
# it must be safe to bootstrap in place. INTEGRATION.md rule 2 forbids the
# reverse — putting a PARENT-only concern inside a constituent — which is not
# what these are.
.skill-manager/
.claude/
.codex/
.gemini/
